%% The widget declarations of GSN's app (vGLP, Section 6.2, Definition "Widget Declaration"): the approval question of its platform, Approval, drawn by the construct family's approval_sentence, one sentence for the attempt's class and two buttons labelled for it (glp_multiagent/lib/ui_runtime/named_widgets.dart).  They are the app's, not the platform's: platform.vglp stays as vGLP's compiler prints it.
Approval =::= approval_sentence.
